{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一视觉入口是上半屏左侧的大号白色文字段落，字号最大、亮度最高，占据主要视野；右上角蓝色小字“离开后才发现心里空了”是次级入口，底部金色音符动画相对暗。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人心里仍憋着一股气，想起过去曾被人当作自己人时短暂感到高兴；是否已经离开、具体处于什么关系变化中，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、短暂高兴、发酸、失落。\",\n  \"missed\": \"离开后是否真的会过得更好这一核心疑问；从焦躁急切转向柔和怀念的情绪变化；越亲切越感到过去遥远；短暂轻松却没有获得答案。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块文字很长，一块里包含回忆、现实处境、疑问、音乐感受和情绪变化好几层意思。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在多个长句中，需要读过前后几层内容才能理解过去的亲密感与离开后的失落之间的关系。\",\n    \"右上角目录文字虽然提供了“离开后才发现心里空了”的概括，但字号明显较小，不能替代主文字中的具体处境和情绪关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "88ef20e4-6045-4957-8938-4165408d4178", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T020734094876Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.359, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:08:22.452956+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "959954926720c299524c9ffe5b35297105d71aa8643cee855c87c56dd539c7f3", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_s